= Clémentine Fourrier

~~~
{}{img_left}{img/logo.jpg}{}{130px}{}{}

== Welcome!
I am a Ph.D student (under the supervision of [http://alpage.inria.fr/~sagot/ Benoît Sagot]), in the [https://team.inria.fr/almanach/fr/ ALMAnaCH team] in [https://www.inria.fr/centre/paris Inria Paris]. I work on using neural networks for historical linguistics, and how that can improve low resource machine translation. (Also interested in  neural network interpretability).

Before that, I worked as a software engineer for a couple of years (see my [https://www.linkedin.com/in/clefourrier/ LinkedIn]).

You can find my NLP publications, software/databases, and talks in the ressources page.

~~~

